      "sourceTextSha256": "c64b8490570539b4f7983a2276ba0aedd89f97187b9f283e119a6b9d2d526b77",
      "text": "Days 10–11 · A former fishing village about 170 km east of Rio, Búzios has an intimate feel, a mild climate, exotic vegetation and picture-perfect beaches, with golden sands, crystal-clear water, green hills, rocky cliffs and beautiful sunsets. Besides relaxing by the sea, surfing, scuba diving, water-skiing and kayaking are popular; a boat trip with a local fisherman reveals turtles, tropical fish and, in season, even whales. In the evening, chic restaurants and stylish bars open their doors along the cobbled streets: the perfect family spot to unwind after your Brazilian journey.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1E-247rYLeM0LW2o8EXezGL6SYp5TNFRI",
